data: {"id": "a89fa8f170994b2f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1787", "run_id": "a89fa8f170994b2f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 仍为 **Pending**，容器状态 **Waiting (ContainerCreating)**，自 2026-09-10 一直未变化。\n2. **关键事件原文**：kubelet/multus 反复上报 **Warning NoNetworkFound**，错误信息为：\n   > `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): \"unavailable-network\" not found`\n3. **Pod 注解**：`k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` — Pod 通过 Multus CNI 请求附加网络定义 `unavailable-network`。\n4. **Prometheus Metrics**：\n   - `kube_po", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789063013276, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a89fa8f170994b2f-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "a89fa8f170994b2f", "seq": 1788, "ts_ms": 1789063022450, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 56.25, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/a89fa8f170994b2f-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "26696ac3ea9bcb811c6e277f0deb162776c1191216cece33a304547dd2199b55", "bytes": 2634}, "snapshot_sha256": "7b5840e13221c54c038c5a53603e35c5a6e9164b920ff5e07e73a2c713514635"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "a89fa8f170994b2f-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "a89fa8f170994b2f", "seq": 1789, "ts_ms": 1789063022450, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a89fa8f170994b2f-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "a89fa8f170994b2f", "seq": 1790, "ts_ms": 1789063030596, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.145, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1604, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh in aiops-case-05 remains in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | Warning NoNetworkFound: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) | 明确指示 Multus 在启动时无法找到所需的网络定义资源 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox: failed to setup network for sandbox... plugin type=\"multus\"... failed getting the delegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) | 证实 Multus 插件失败直接导致 Pod Sandbox 创建失败，且持续重试 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\", count=1) | 状态指标确认容器处于等待网络配置完成的状态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nK8s 事件（#1, #2）与指标数据（#3）形成闭环。多源 Multus 事件详细描述了具体的错误原因（找不到 `unavailable-network` 定义），导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱，进而反映在 Prometheus 指标中容器长期处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。Logging 和 Tracing 未采集到数据是因为容器未能启动，这符合网络前置依赖失败的特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 解析网络配置失败 → Pod Sandbox 创建失败，Multus 持续报错 → Pod 永久处于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：集群中 Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 引用的 CNI 网络定义 `unavailable-network` 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在（见证据 #1, #2）。由于网络插件 Multus 无法在启动时找到该定义，导致容器运行时环境（Sandbox）无法初始化，进而使 Pod 无法进入运行状态（见证据 #3）。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实：**\n目前缺乏证据表明该 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源是“本应存在但因其他原因丢失”，还是“Pod 部署清单中错误地引用了未定义的资源”。因此无法确认故障根源在于网络配置遗漏还是部署配置错误。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh in aiops-case-05 remains in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | Warning NoNetworkFound: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) | 明确指示 Multus 在启动时无法找到所需的网络定义资源 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox: failed to setup network for sandbox... plugin type=\"multus\"... failed getting the delegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) | 证实 Multus 插件失败直接导致 Pod Sandbox 创建失败，且持续重试 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\", count=1) | 状态指标确认容器处于等待网络配置完成的状态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nK8s 事件（#1, #2）与指标数据（#3）形成闭环。多源 Multus 事件详细描述了具体的错误原因（找不到 `unavailable-network` 定义），导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱，进而反映在 Prometheus 指标中容器长期处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。Logging 和 Tracing 未采集到数据是因为容器未能启动，这符合网络前置依赖失败的特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 解析网络配置失败 → Pod Sandbox 创建失败，Multus 持续报错 → Pod 永久处于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：集群中 Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 引用的 CNI 网络定义 `unavailable-network` 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在（见证据 #1, #2）。由于网络插件 Multus 无法在启动时找到该定义，导致容器运行时环境（Sandbox）无法初始化，进而使 Pod 无法进入运行状态（见证据 #3）。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实：**\n目前缺乏证据表明该 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源是“本应存在但因其他原因丢失”，还是“Pod 部署清单中错误地引用了未定义的资源”。因此无法确认故障根源在于网络配置遗漏还是部署配置错误。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

